// Into a fissure by its east mouth (24 m down), to the mouth's inner edge, at no cost. The layout (sites.rs,
// PR #8) joins every part of the fissure to a way in (tests/found_places.rs; floor and bridges, with ropes).
// Not walked on from here: a running mole steps off the mouth into a 0.5 m slot before the bridge (which sits
// 0.75 m up) and falls (in about 1 s it's 3 m down; carrying on left, 5 m more for ~21 hp). The ropes hang under
// the bridges, so from above the way down is a drop. Movement polish item (see REFINE-movement.md).
map
